1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
Nuri, watch — my camel can jump THIS high today!

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,000
That's the highest yet!

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Time for bed, little camel... camel?

4
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,000
Zayd couldn't find his toy camel anywhere.

5
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,500
Not here... Not here either...

6
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,500
You've looked so hard already, habibi.

7
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,500
I looked everywhere, Ummi. What if it's really gone?

8
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:29,000
You did your best. Now — let's ask Allah to help us,
and keep looking together, calmly.

9
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:33,000
Hasbunallahu wa ni'mal wakeel.

10
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Wait... did you bring him to the park in your bag?

11
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:20,000
My park bag!

12
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:28,500
Alhamdulillah! You were right here the whole time!

13
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:18,000
Hasbunallahu wa ni'mal wakeel.

14
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:21,500
Allah is always enough for us.
